#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:5
#: 6e88e887cf2a44ba89e73fe3f0f7767a
msgid "Archived: Loading the code onto APM2.x"
msgstr "已存档：将代码烧录到 APM2.x"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:8
#: 241d8f35c1534d23b4e8dd354665c950
msgid "What you'll need:"
msgstr "所需物品："

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:10
#: 35fc6068813f4777a7752491d162176e
msgid "mini USB cable (for APM1) or micro USB cable (for APM2)"
msgstr "Mini USB 数据线（用于 APM1）或 Micro USB 数据线（用于 APM2）"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:11
#: 7daa82fb1602470eaa2df35343868c30
msgid ""
"modified version of the Arduino IDE for \\ `windows "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Arduino/>`__ or `macintosh "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Arduino/>`__"
msgstr ""
"适用于 \\ `windows <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Arduino/>`__ 或 "
"`macintosh <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Arduino/>`__ 的修改版 Arduino "
"IDE"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:15
#: d70a294c0e1145088528e9903e1161d2
msgid "Setting up the software drivers"
msgstr "安装软件驱动程序"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:17
#: f77770a0e0ac45bfaa70ba53104114e9
msgid ""
"First, download and install Arduino (see links above). If you've never used "
"Arduino before, please use \\ `these setup instructions "
"<http://arduino.cc/en/Guide/HomePage>`__ to become familiar with Arduino "
"basics."
msgstr ""
"首先，下载并安装 Arduino（见上方链接）。如果你从未用过 Arduino，请按 \\ `这些安装说明 "
"<http://arduino.cc/en/Guide/HomePage>`__ 熟悉 Arduino 的基础知识。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:21
#: a66006f825484f2ab8b88008e0b4c5df
msgid ""
"Next, set up the drivers for the USB interface to APM. Most people will use "
"a regular USB-A to miniB cable (regular USB on one side, mini USB on the "
"other) to connect to APM via the IMU shield, but if you're not using that "
"shield you can use a FTDI cable. Pictures showing how to plug in these "
"cables are below."
msgstr ""
"接下来，安装 APM USB 接口的驱动程序。大多数人会使用标准 USB-A 转 miniB 数据线（一端为标准 USB，另一端为 mini "
"USB）通过 IMU 扩展板连接 APM，但如果不使用该扩展板，也可以使用 FTDI 数据线。下方有图片展示这些数据线的插接方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:27
#: 51cc1925783c4be48e50608c920bfba7
msgid ""
"When you plug APM or the FTDI cable the first time to your PC, Windows 7 "
"should recognize the FTDI USB-to-serial chip and install the right drivers, "
"but if it doesn't or if you're using an earlier version of Windows, you "
"should download and install the appropriate driver for your Operating System"
" from \\ `here <http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/VCP.htm>`__. Once you've "
"done so, reboot your PC and plug in the cable again. It should be recognized"
" and show up in your Windows Device Manger (which you can find in the "
"Windows Control Panel) as shown below (your COM port will probably be a "
"different number; it's assigned by Windows based on how many other devices "
"you've connected). That's the COM port you'll use in Arduino and all other "
"USB interactions with APM."
msgstr ""
"第一次把 APM 或 FTDI 线插到 PC 上时，Windows 7 应能识别 FTDI USB "
"转串口芯片并安装正确的驱动。如果没有，或者你用的是更早版本的 Windows，请从 \\ `这里 "
"<http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/VCP.htm>`__ 下载并安装适合你操作系统的驱动。装好后重启 PC "
"并重新插线，它应能被识别并出现在 Windows 设备管理器（可在控制面板中找到）里，如下图所示（你的 COM 口号很可能不同：它由 Windows "
"根据你接过多少其他设备来分配）。这就是你在 Arduino 及所有其他与 APM 的 USB 交互中要用的 COM 口。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:40
#: a16e690fa7e346b088c15d5b8814dc1a
msgid ""
"*Note: if you're using the FTDI cable, you must go to the Control "
"Panel/Device Manager and make a change to the COM port assigned to the "
"FTDI/USB cable. Find the USB Serial Port entry as shown here (your FTDI may "
"have been assigned to a different port than the 3 shown below; it doesn't "
"matter what number it's given) and under Properties/Port Settings/Advanced, "
"ensure that the \"Set RTS On Close\" box is checked, as shown below. Once "
"you've made this change once, you won't have to do it again.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：如果使用 FTDI 数据线，必须进入控制面板/设备管理器，对分配给 FTDI/USB 数据线的 COM 端口进行修改。找到如图所示的 USB "
"串口条目（你的 FTDI 可能被分配到与下图不同的端口，端口号无关紧要），在属性/端口设置/高级中，确保勾选了「关闭时设置 "
"RTS」选项，如下图所示。此更改只需进行一次，之后无需重复操作。*"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:53
#: 3eac81e509ae4e1e8e75690fb0e09c8c
msgid "Connecting the cable"
msgstr "连接数据线"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:55
#: ba28dc20f5624703826f56dd00041fba
msgid ""
"The FTDI or USB cable will provide sufficient power for desktop use, but "
"will probably not drive more than two regular servos. If you want to drive "
"more servos than that or if you're using digital servos, you'll need to have"
" an additional power supply (usually an ESC connected to one of the APM "
"servo outputs)."
msgstr ""
"FTDI 或 USB "
"数据线可为桌面使用提供足够的电源，但可能无法驱动超过两个普通舵机。如果需要驱动更多舵机或使用数字舵机，则需要额外的电源（通常是连接到 APM "
"某个舵机输出端的电调）。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:61
#: 563579e60cc64c5897077ce525d03c0e
msgid "If you're using a USB cable, connect it here:"
msgstr "如果使用 USB 数据线，请连接到此处："

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:66
#: a21cd274b9c343e28ea6a60d6992d258
msgid ""
"If you're using an FTDI cable, connect it here, noting the marking for the "
"black and green sides of the cable:"
msgstr "如果使用 FTDI 数据线，请连接到此处，注意数据线黑色和绿色端的标记："

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:73
#: 17102857ec5c40beb9e7d0ea34e0454f
msgid "Setting the Sketchbook folder"
msgstr "设置 Sketchbook 文件夹"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:75
#: 22649d205c584a9ca45edfbdc3efaa16
msgid ""
"Next you must define the folder Arduino will use for its \"sketches\" "
"(Arduino-talk for the set of files that compose a program) and libraries"
msgstr "接下来，你必须定义 Arduino 用于存放「sketches」（Arduino 术语，指构成程序的文件集合）和库的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:78
#: cc306c5d9abe462e8d2c053dbb0bd78d
msgid ""
"Create a folder someplace where you can find it, perhaps in your Documents "
"folder or even on your desktop. (If you've been using Arduino, you probably "
"have this set up somewhere already). Launch the Arduino IDE and open the \\ "
"**Preferences** dialog. Set the sketchbook location to the\\ ``Sketchbook`` "
"folder you created or are using. Here's where I have mine:"
msgstr ""
"在你方便找到的地方创建一个文件夹，例如在文档文件夹中或桌面上。（如果你之前使用过 Arduino，可能已经在某处设置过。）启动 Arduino IDE "
"并打开「首选项」对话框。将 sketchbook 位置设置为你创建或正在使用的 ``Sketchbook`` 文件夹。下图是我的设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:88
#: c1d4aba8eb3146a19d7c812b6aeed1c8
msgid ""
"Once you've changed that directory, you must close Arduino and restart it "
"for it to be recognized."
msgstr "更改该目录后，必须关闭 Arduino 并重启，更改才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:92
#: cc18133936f54defa0918d4115e0106a
msgid "Setting the board type"
msgstr "设置开发板类型"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:94
#: 34d2eb5f2a0b496b8016531d06aaa295
msgid ""
"In our modified version of the Arduino IDE there is a new \"ArduPilot\" menu"
" which allows you to select the board type."
msgstr "在我们修改版的 Arduino IDE 中，新增了「ArduPilot」菜单，可用于选择开发板类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:97
#: 605ec8802d09419ba0710dfa38d5af43
msgid ""
"For Copter version 2.9.1 and earlier you should select the \"None\" from "
"this menu and then ensure that under Tools, Board is \"ArduinoMega 2560 or "
"Mega ADK\". If you are using an APM2 you will also need to uncomment line 5 "
"from APM_Config.h (see bottom screenshot)"
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 2.9.1 及更早版本，应从该菜单中选择「None」，然后确保在工具菜单中，开发板选择「ArduinoMega 2560 or "
"Mega ADK」。如果使用 APM2，还需要取消 APM_Config.h 第 5 行的注释（见底部截图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:102
#: 3a43b5a3825540f985d4eca3e7570120
msgid ""
"For versions later than 2.9.1 you should set the \"ArduPilot\", \"HAL "
"Board\" to either \"ArduPilot Mega 1\" or \"ArduPilot Mega 2.x\" depending "
"on which board you are programming."
msgstr ""
"对于 2.9.1 之后的版本，应将「ArduPilot」菜单中的「HAL Board」设置为「ArduPilot Mega 1」或「ArduPilot "
"Mega 2.x」，具体取决于你正在烧录的开发板。"

#: ../../source/docs/load-the-code-onto-apm2x.rst:108
#: 6cbd580bbeed46dfab5a0087a3e3731d
msgid "You will need to restart your Arduino IDE after changing the above."
msgstr "更改上述设置后，需要重启 Arduino IDE。"
